    "title": "Woodrows DuckPin bowling coming to The Villages - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Report ,\n6 hours ago A new way to bowl, gather and have some friendly competition is coming to The Villages. Woodrows DuckPin will officially open its doors at 11 a.m. Thursday, Sept. 17 at 2298 Randy McDaniels Way in downtown Middleton, bringing 10 lanes of duckpin bowling along with a full-service bar, food options and a lively new social experience to the community. Read full article",
